// Seed content for the P0 loop. Only Mathematics has real cards for now —
// every other subject is listed (so Home/Progress show the full CBC subject
// set) but starts empty until a content-source decision is made.
//
// Bump SEED_VERSION whenever this file's cards change. On next launch,
// db.ts wipes and re-inserts the `cards` table when the device's stored
// seed_version is behind — so content edits actually reach devices that
// already seeded an earlier version, without wiping grade/streak/stars.

